WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.518
The moon phase tarot spread uses eight cards,
one for each phase of the lunar cycle.

00:00:06.518 --> 00:00:11.266
The phases work as a metaphor for
starting, building, seeing and releasing.

00:00:12.566 --> 00:00:13.779
The eight positions.

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:18.208
New moon, waxing crescent, first quarter,
waxing gibbous, then full moon.

00:00:19.508 --> 00:00:20.648
Laying it in a ring.

00:00:20.648 --> 00:00:27.089
Place the cards in a circle, with the new moon at the top and
the rest following clockwise, like a moon calendar.

00:00:28.389 --> 00:00:29.993
Using it in a single sitting.

00:00:29.993 --> 00:00:32.592
Most people lay the full spread in one
session.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:36.339
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:36.339 --> 00:00:41.097
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
